  "plan": "# Investiments' Plan\n\n## Allocation\n80% EHTY11 4% COIN11 3% XBCI11, 2% AURO11/GOLD11/XAUT, 1% SPXS11, 1% NASD11, 5% XAU/SP500/SP100 day trading, 3% GPCA11 1% RARA11 & others\n\n# Day Trading Plan\n\n## Analyse and Execute\n1- Check current Volatility and news of the asset to be traded to adjust pips' sizes\n2 - Check Moving Averages to identify it the Market is trending or sideways\n3 - If Market is trending, if there is multiple timeframes' confirmation of trend, if Manipulation already happened, if RSI agrees and price is not near any Support/Resistance; so Buy/Sell 1/2% Risk/Return\n4 - If Market is trending, but previous criteria doesn't meet, so do Inverse Iron Condor with 1/3% Risk/Return on Buy and 1/3% on Sell\n5 - If Market is Sideways, so check RSI to do Scalping of 1/2% Risk/Return\n6 - If 2 losses in a row, or 2% down in the Day/Position, so Stop Trading and Investing for the day\n7 - Daily Profit Target: 0.25% to most 4% of Day trading account size, from Sunday 7pm to Friday 6pm\n\n## Review\n- Journal every position.\n- Review winners and losers weekly.\n- Track execution quality, not only P/L.",
